      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gardendale%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1996 Olympic torch relay paused in Gardendale just weeks before the Atlanta Games, marking a national moment.",
